Section: 4.2. Results
Text: The complete results are presented in table 5 below. The experiment with linguistic features was the combina- tion of dependency relation tags with TF/IDF unigrams. This experimented yielded the same F1-score of 80% as the other Linear SVM classiﬁers, performing almost iden- tically with the previous model trained with POS tags, only bested in precision for the Offensive class.

Rank: 3
